     [38;5;246mtask_event rows as the audit trail, one notification row per subscriber referencing the event. Indexed inbox query,
[39m     [38;5;246mper-item read state, free task history, good basis for phase-2 email digests.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Denormalized notifications
     [38;5;246mSingle table, message text per recipient. Smallest schema. No event history, duplicated text, and no way to [39m
